      "filename": "Building at the corner of King Street and Friars Street, Stirling (28498498942).jpg",
      "title": "File:Building at the corner of King Street and Friars Street, Stirling (28498498942).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0b/Building_at_the_corner_of_King_Street_and_Friars_Street%2C_Stirling_%2828498498942%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
